{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/388241-alternate-proctor-arcanoi","id":388241,"title":"Alternate Proctor Arcanoi","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-01T03:31:57-08:00","id":388241,"title":"Alternate Proctor Arcanoi","content":"As a guild I often find myself drawn to the Proctors. However their Arcanoi though quite powerful, does feel a little limited in terms of variety and substance.<br /> <br /> I was wondering if anyone had come up with any homegrown alternate arts for this guild?<br /> <br /> Or do people just prefer to avoid them altogether and come up with a handy Embody Artifact should a Skinland sojourn be needed?<br /> <br /> All insight is greatly appreciated as I've been an avid follower of this game for many many year, yet still have yet to play it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>I'm God's hated messenger, the Devil's cohort<br /> I'm the one they all blame, when a life is cut short<br /> But still if you're willing, to give it a try<br /> I'll beat you at anything, and claim you're last sigh</i><br /> - The Reaper's Tales","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4688-malkira","name":"Malkira","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-01T04:29:51-08:00","id":388312,"title":"","content":"Back in 1998 someone wrote an unofficial Guildbook Proctor. A copy can be found here: <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://mekanismi.sange.fi/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Sourcebooks/GuildbookProctors\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://mekanismi.sange.fi/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Sourcebooks/pub/skins/unstrapped/images/mekanismi-logo-white-40.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mekanismi.sange.fi/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Sourcebooks/GuildbookProctors\" target=\"_blank\"> Mekanismi / Main / </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mekanismi.sange.fi/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Sourcebooks/GuildbookProctors\" target=\"_blank\"> http://mekanismi.sange.fi/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Sourcebooks/GuildbookProctors </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I also posted a Tempered Arcanoi involving Embody a few months ago:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/294172-wto-tempered-arcanoi\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/294172-wto-tempered-arcanoi\"> WtO: Tempered Arcanoi - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/294172-wto-tempered-arcanoi\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/294172-wto-tempered-arcanoi </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Share your Tempered Arcanoi you may have created over the years. This one was inspired from the 2nd Edition description of Embody where is was described as </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3138-old-rusty-pipe","name":"Old Rusty Pipe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-01T04:57:59-08:00","id":388324,"title":"","content":"Do note that were getting a brand new version of Embody, with alternate Arts, when Wraith20 hit's the printer, or rather when they make it into a PDF.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile I personally have always preferred Puppetry for Skinlands sojourns, Wylding for general mayhem with a touch of Outrage if something absolutely needs to go. Then there is of course Inhabit which allows for a different type of Skinlands sojourn and Flux offering a way to cross the Shroud as well. It all depends on which kind of trip or interaction you had in mind though Puppetry can handle most situations rather well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-03T08:57:04-08:00","id":391485,"title":"","content":"Orpheus had a power that could create a copy of person, made out of plasm and manifested in the skinlands, that could be possessed as in Puppetry. Imagine a clone, like the ones form the movie the Thing. I think a power like this would be a good addition to Embody's arts. Just make the &quot;clone&quot; automatically fall under the Proctor's control, or simply be its Embodied body.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/412-valismedsen","name":"valismedsen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar412_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-03T12:59:52-08:00","id":391775,"title":"","content":"Hmm I hadn't thought of that. My ideas mostly revolved around proctors possessing abilities that could allow a wraith to manifest their other arcanoi or artefacts in the skinlands I imagined it would tip them over into the forbidden rather than criminal guilds - but I could work with that <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>I'm God's hated messenger, the Devil's cohort<br /> I'm the one they all blame, when a life is cut short<br /> But still if you're willing, to give it a try<br /> I'll beat you at anything, and claim you're last sigh</i><br /> - The Reaper's Tales","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4688-malkira","name":"Malkira","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}